  "details": "Please allow us to rebind controls for  hand tracking...i have been useing hand tracking for the  quest three for a year now.. and  the hand tracking needs work as gripping and useing are technically the same gesture  and can lead to some unfortunate issues with certain worlds within vrchat. Also the rotation aspect of the hand tracking mode theres no way to get a true \"forward\" for some worlds preventing alot of interactions with features with in the community to  actually work... please  allow us to also have \"sticky grip\" with hand tracking so that hand tracking users arnt dropping everything or interacting with everything.... theres no in-between ive tried... im at my wits end with handtracking as is but its a nice feature however",
